┌───────────────────────────────┐
│   1. How to build             │
└───────────────────────────────┘

for FindWayland.cmake (NOT NEEDED ANYMORE)
 $ sudo apt install extra-cmake-modules

for SDL3
 clone the git repo and place it in `extern/SDL`

for xdg-shell.xml (NOT NEEDED ANYMORE)
 $ sudo apt install wayland-protocols

for hwloc
 clone the git repo ans place it in `extern/hwloc`

Prepare a cmake directory there
 $ CC=clang-20 cmake -B build-Debug -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Debug -G Ninja
 $ CC=clang-20 cmake -B build-RelWithDebInfo -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=RelWithDebInfo -G Ninja
 $ CC=clang-20 cmake -B build-ship_it -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release -G Ninja

Start building
 $ time cmake --build build-RelWithDebInfo -- -j $(nproc)

You can get the list of the compile commands and use it for auto-complete or other useful tools.
 $ ln -s build-RelWithDebInfo/compile_commands.json .

If the build fails because the object of libhwloc is missing:
 $ mkdir -p build-Debug/extern && cd $_ && ln -s ../../extern/hwloc/hwloc/.libs/libhwloc.a ./ && cd -
 $ mkdir -p build-RelWithDebInfo/extern && cd $_ && ln -s ../../extern/hwloc/hwloc/.libs/libhwloc.a ./ && cd -
 $ mkdir -p build-ship_it/extern && cd $_ && ln -s ../../extern/hwloc/hwloc/.libs/libhwloc.a ./ && cd -

Remove the original cmake build directory and reconfigure
 $ BUILD_DIRECTORY=build-Debug && rm -rf $BUILD_DIRECTORY && CC=clang-20 cmake -B $BUILD_DIRECTORY -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Debug -G Ninja && mkdir -p $BUILD_DIRECTORY/extern && cd $_ && ln -s ../../extern/hwloc/hwloc/.libs/libhwloc.a ./ && cd -
 $ BUILD_DIRECTORY=build-RelWithDebInfo && rm -rf $BUILD_DIRECTORY && CC=clang-20 cmake -B $BUILD_DIRECTORY -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=RelWithDebInfo -G Ninja && mkdir -p $BUILD_DIRECTORY/extern && cd $_ && ln -s ../../extern/hwloc/hwloc/.libs/libhwloc.a ./ && cd -
 $ BUILD_DIRECTORY=build-ship_it && rm -rf $BUILD_DIRECTORY && CC=clang-20 cmake -B $BUILD_DIRECTORY -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release -G Ninja && mkdir -p $BUILD_DIRECTORY/extern && cd $_ && ln -s ../../extern/hwloc/hwloc/.libs/libhwloc.a ./ && cd -

Debug
 $ valgrind --track-origins=yes --leak-check=yes build-RelWithDebInfo/RelWithDebInfo/carbonara 
 $ build-Debug/Debug/carbonara
 $ build-RelWithDebInfo/RelWithDebInfo/carbonara
